    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I volunteer at a charity shop once a week. Before store hours, I need to do some preparation work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The donations we get include clothes, books, cameras and more. Today, to begin with, I went through the items to make sure that they were all "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "in good condition",
            "ref": "v-in-good-condition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Then, I put each piece of clothing on a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hanger",
            "ref": "v-hanger"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and checked the size "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tag",
            "ref": "v-tag"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Besides this, we also need to make the window "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "display",
            "ref": "v-display"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We usually base our design on one main item or piece of clothing. This time, I chose a lovely orange dress, and then found some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "accessories",
            "zh": "配饰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " which "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "went",
            "ref": "v-go-well-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " really "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "well with",
            "ref": "v-go-well-with"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After all the preparation work was done, we opened the store. I greeted our customers and introduced the goods to them. When there were no customers, I took the time to learn more about the items. In this way, I could tell our guests more information if they asked, such as the story of a book or the year in which an old camera was made."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I love this job. It has taught me new skills and allowed me to gain more experience. If you want to pay society back like me, why not give a charity shop a try?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
